  "what_this_artifact_is_not": "it is not a result. It fixes what will be asked. No tensor byte was read to produce it, and the test named in this file's docstring checks that no address-space import exists here.",
  "why_deferred": "these words have no unique single-token id in the donor's vocabulary; probing them means encoding them with the donor's BPE and taking a sub-token, which is a different probe object. The BPE encoder is not implemented in this step and is a named follow-on. They are not silently dropped, and they were not selected for or against on anything seen in the weight bytes."
